{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d159","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a1aa16-6120-7543-8e87-aff60485fd0b"},"sequence":1799,"recorded_at":1780531400003593,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a1aa16-642f-7fb0-a5fe-8d2aa3acfb85","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"command_id":"01a1aa16-642f-7fb0-a5fe-8d2aa3acfb85","event":{"chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: line 89\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-  boot: [\"Zeroing the scale\", \"Sanding the instructors\", \"Counting the ducks\", \"Telling the hippo\"],\n+  extra: [\n+    \"Your posture has a posture. They get along.\",\n+    \"I measured the room while you were gone. It is still a room.\",\n+    \"Standing is just falling, with confidence and ankles.\",\n+    \"You blinked. I counted it as rest. You are welcome.\",\n+    \"The mats have missed you. They are very flat about it.\",\n+    \"Gerald heard about your minutes. He said nothing. He is thrilled.\",\n+    \"A good lean is a small promise you keep with your feet.\",\n+    \"I do not sleep. I practise being horizontal, accurately.\",\n+    \"Your left side and right side had a meeting. You were the agenda.\",\n+    \"Breathe like the building is listening. It is. I am.\",\n+    \"Stillness is not empty. It is full of not falling over.\",\n+    \"You stood here once. The floor remembers the shape fondly.\",\n+    \"Effort looks good on you. So does stopping. Choose kindly.\",\n+    \"The instructors never blink. Please blink enough for everyone.\",\n+    \"A star is just a point that tried in five directions.\",\n+    \"Your spine filed a report. It was mostly positive. One wobble appealed.\",\n+    \"Water helps. So does sitting. So does standing. I am very helpful.\",\n+    \"The gulls judge no one. They merely watch, with beaks.\",\n+    \"Dennis watered the olives again. Nobody stops him. Morale reasons.\",\n+    \"Marisol has lapped the day. The day has asked her to slow down.\",\n+    \"Young Kevin stretched once in 2019. He is still dining out on it.\",\n+    \"Mr. Okafor applauded a chair today. The chair had it coming.\",\n+    \"Lou's break continues. We do not wake excellence.\",\n+    \"The Twins synchronised a nod. It took three rehearsals.\",\n+    \"Gertrude's hat has its own Spine Age. It does not discuss it.\",\n+    \"The laundry line believes in you, at clothesline height.\",\n+    \"A hoop returned today. They always come back. That is their whole deal.\",\n+    \"The candle is not lonely. It has a flame and boundaries.\",\n+    \"Trays come and trays go. The gecko remains. The gecko always remains.\",\n+    \"Snow on Mount Posture is just rain that committed.\",\n+    \"Please return your wobble to the upright position. Thank you.\"\n+  ],\n+  boot: [\"Zeroing the scale\", \"Sanding the instructors\", \"Counting the ducks\", \"Telling the hippo\"],\n","final_result":true,"kind":"output","task_id":"01a1aa1f-6f47-7e52-8099-431f260b967a"},"kind":"task_lifecycle","run_stream":{"id":"01a1aa16-642f-7fb0-a5fe-8d2aa3acfb85","kind":"run"},"task_id":"01a1aa1f-6f47-7e52-8099-431f260b967a","task_stream":{"id":"01a1aa1f-6f47-7e52-8099-431f260b967a","kind":"task"}}}
